WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Find care on your schedule. Search by city, age group, and 24-hour availability.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Get to know each center. Review hours, caregivers, safety details, and listed plans.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Request a place with confidence. Check availability, then request hourly, daily, or monthly care.

